    {
      "kind": "utterance",
      "external_id": "u_c2_public_consultation_consult",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c2-public-consultation-01",
        "text": {
          "en": "A consultation is weak if it asks for views after the central decision is already irreversible."
        },
        "translations": {
          "fa": "مشورت عمومی وقتی ضعیفه که بعد از برگشت‌ناپذیر شدن تصمیم اصلی نظر بخواد."
        },
        "intent": "evaluate_consultation",
        "concept_refs": [
          "c2_public_consultation_consultation",
          "c2_public_consultation_legitimacy"
        ],
        "cefr": "C2",
        "topic": "simple-messages",
        "register": "neutral",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "utterance",
      "external_id": "u_c2_public_consultation_stake",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c2-public-consultation-01",
        "text": {
          "en": "Stakeholder mapping should include people who bear costs without having organized representation."
        },
        "translations": {
          "fa": "نقشه ذی‌نفع‌ها باید آدم‌هایی رو هم شامل بشه که هزینه می‌دن ولی نمایندگی سازمان‌یافته ندارن."
        },
        "intent": "map_hidden_stakeholders",
        "concept_refs": [
          "c2_public_consultation_stakeholder",
          "c2_public_consultation_representation"
        ],
        "cefr": "C2",
        "topic": "simple-messages",
        "register": "neutral",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "utterance",
      "external_id": "u_c2_public_consultation_participation",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c2-public-consultation-02",
        "text": {
          "en": "High participation does not guarantee representative participation if the process systematically favors people with more time or resources."
        },
        "translations": {
          "fa": "مشارکت زیاد لزوماً نماینده بودن رو تضمین نمی‌کنه اگر فرایند به شکل نظام‌مند به نفع افراد با زمان یا منابع بیشتر باشه."
        },
        "intent": "question_participation_bias",
        "concept_refs": [
          "c2_public_consultation_participation",
          "c2_public_consultation_representation"
        ],
        "cefr": "C2",
        "topic": "simple-messages",
        "register": "neutral",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "utterance",
      "external_id": "u_c2_public_consultation_deliberation",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c2-public-consultation-02",
        "text": {
          "en": "Deliberation is more than collecting preferences; participants need enough shared information to respond to each other's reasons."
        },
        "translations": {
          "fa": "بحث سنجیده بیشتر از جمع کردن ترجیحه؛ شرکت‌کننده‌ها باید اطلاعات مشترک کافی داشته باشن تا به دلایل همدیگه پاسخ بدن."
        },
        "intent": "define_deliberation",
        "concept_refs": [
          "c2_public_consultation_deliberation",
          "c2_public_consultation_consultation"
        ],
        "cefr": "C2",
        "topic": "simple-messages",
        "register": "neutral",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "utterance",
      "external_id": "u_c2_public_consultation_mandate",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c2-public-consultation-03",
        "text": {
          "en": "The committee's mandate is advisory, so it can strengthen legitimacy without pretending to replace the elected decision-maker."
        },
        "translations": {
          "fa": "مأموریت کمیته مشورتیه، پس می‌تونه مشروعیت رو تقویت کنه بدون اینکه وانمود کنه جای تصمیم‌گیر منتخب رو می‌گیره."
        },
        "intent": "clarify_mandate",
        "concept_refs": [
          "c2_public_consultation_mandate",
          "c2_public_consultation_legitimacy"
        ],
        "cefr": "C2",
        "topic": "simple-messages",
        "register": "neutral",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "utterance",
      "external_id": "u_c2_public_consultation_tradeoff",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c2-public-consultation-03",
        "text": {
          "en": "A fair process should make the trade-off explicit when improving access for one group reduces convenience for another."
        },
        "translations": {
          "fa": "فرایند عادلانه باید مصالحه رو صریح کنه وقتی بهتر کردن دسترسی یک گروه راحتی گروه دیگه رو کم می‌کنه."
        },
        "intent": "surface_public_tradeoff",
        "concept_refs": [
          "c2_public_consultation_tradeoff",
          "c2_public_consultation_stakeholder"
        ],
        "cefr": "C2",
        "topic": "simple-messages",
        "register": "neutral",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "utterance",
      "external_id": "u_c2_public_consultation_legitimacy",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c2-public-consultation-03",
        "text": {
          "en": "Procedural legitimacy cannot rescue every bad outcome, but opaque procedure can undermine even a reasonable decision."
        },
        "translations": {
          "fa": "مشروعیت رویه‌ای هر نتیجه بدی رو نجات نمی‌ده، ولی روال مبهم می‌تونه حتی تصمیم منطقی رو هم تضعیف کنه."
        },
        "intent": "discuss_procedural_legitimacy",
        "concept_refs": [
          "c2_public_consultation_legitimacy",
          "c2_public_consultation_consultation"
        ],
        "cefr": "C2",
        "topic": "simple-messages",
        "register": "neutral",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "utterance",
      "external_id": "u_c2_public_consultation_summary",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c2-public-consultation-03",
        "text": {
          "en": "Credible consultation makes participation limits, stakeholder effects, trade-offs and the actual decision mandate visible from the start."
        },
        "translations": {
          "fa": "مشورت معتبر از ابتدا محدودیت‌های مشارکت، اثر بر ذی‌نفع‌ها، مصالحه‌ها و اختیار واقعی تصمیم رو روشن می‌کنه."
        },
        "intent": "summarize_public_consultation",
        "concept_refs": [
          "c2_public_consultation_participation",
          "c2_public_consultation_stakeholder",
          "c2_public_consultation_mandate"
        ],
        "cefr": "C2",
        "topic": "simple-messages",
        "register": "neutral",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "grammar_point",
      "external_id": "g_c2_public_consultation_concession_rebuttal",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c2-public-consultation-01",
        "slug": "c2-public-consultation-concession-rebuttal",
        "title": "Concession followed by rebuttal",
        "rule_summary": "Acknowledge a reasonable opposing point before limiting it or presenting a stronger counterargument.",
        "explanation": {
          "fa": "ابتدا یک نکته منطقی از طرف مقابل را می‌پذیریم و سپس دامنه آن را محدود می‌کنیم یا پاسخ قوی‌تری می‌دهیم."
        },
        "examples": [
          {
            "en": "Granted, the process is faster; that does not necessarily make it fairer.",
            "fa": "درست است که روند سریع‌تر است؛ اما لزوماً عادلانه‌تر نیست."
          },
          {
            "en": "While that concern is valid, it overlooks the cost of doing nothing.",
            "fa": "با اینکه آن نگرانی معتبر است، هزینه هیچ کاری نکردن را نادیده می‌گیرد."
          }
        ],
        "cefr": "C2",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "grammar_point",
      "external_id": "g_c2_public_consultation_advanced_hedging",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c2-public-consultation-02",
        "slug": "c2-public-consultation-advanced-hedging",
        "title": "Advanced hedging and calibration",
        "rule_summary": "Calibrate certainty with expressions such as arguably, broadly speaking, tends to, appears to, and cannot entirely be ruled out.",
        "explanation": {
          "fa": "در C1 میزان قطعیت را با عبارت‌هایی مثل arguably، broadly speaking، tends to، appears to و cannot entirely be ruled out دقیق تنظیم می‌کنیم."
        },
        "examples": [
          {
            "en": "The change appears to have improved access, although the evidence is still limited.",
            "fa": "به نظر می‌رسد این تغییر دسترسی را بهتر کرده، هرچند شواهد هنوز محدود است."
          },
          {
            "en": "That explanation cannot entirely be ruled out.",
            "fa": "نمی‌توان آن توضیح را کاملاً منتفی دانست."
          }
        ],
        "cefr": "C2",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "grammar_point",
      "external_id": "g_c2_public_consultation_discourse_management",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c2-public-consultation-03",
        "slug": "c2-public-consultation-discourse-management",
        "title": "Managing complex discourse",
        "rule_summary": "Use signposting and metadiscourse to frame, sequence, return to, and close complex points without losing the listener.",
        "explanation": {
          "fa": "با signposting و metadiscourse نکات پیچیده را قاب‌بندی، مرتب، دوباره جمع و نتیجه‌گیری می‌کنیم تا شنونده مسیر بحث را گم نکند."
        },
        "examples": [
          {
            "en": "Before I come back to that point, let me clarify one assumption.",
            "fa": "قبل از اینکه به آن نکته برگردم، بگذار یک فرض را روشن کنم."
          },
          {
            "en": "That brings us to the broader question of accountability.",
            "fa": "این ما را به پرسش گسترده‌تر پاسخ‌گویی می‌رساند."
          }
        ],
        "cefr": "C2",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "external_id": "d_c2_public_consultation_scene_1",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c2-public-consultation-01",
        "title": "Public Consultation, Stakeholders & Deliberative Trade-offs: part 1",
        "setting": "seminar break",
        "cefr": "C2",
        "topic": "simple-messages",
        "characters": [
          "Ella",
          "Amir"
        ],
        "turns": [
          {
            "order": 1,
            "speaker": "Ella",
            "text": "Which assumption is doing most of the work here?",
            "translation_fa": "کدوم فرض بیشترین نقش رو در این استدلال داره؟"
          },
          {
            "order": 2,
            "speaker": "Amir",
            "text": "A consultation is weak if it asks for views after the central decision is already irreversible.",
            "translation_fa": "مشورت عمومی وقتی ضعیفه که بعد از برگشت‌ناپذیر شدن تصمیم اصلی نظر بخواد."
          },
          {
            "order": 3,
            "speaker": "Ella",
            "text": "How would the conclusion change if that assumption failed?",
            "translation_fa": "اگر اون فرض برقرار نباشه نتیجه چطور عوض می‌شه؟"
          },
          {
            "order": 4,
            "speaker": "Amir",
            "text": "Stakeholder mapping should include people who bear costs without having organized representation.",
            "translation_fa": "نقشه ذی‌نفع‌ها باید آدم‌هایی رو هم شامل بشه که هزینه می‌دن ولی نمایندگی سازمان‌یافته ندارن."
          }
        ],
        "status": "approved"
      }
